; ==============================================================================
;  lang\es.rc  -  Español. Texts every theme shares, as Txt<Name> variables.
;  step.rc includes lang\<Language>.rc and then lang\en.rc: a text missing here shows
;  in English. Values stay quoted (a $Var$ expands to its first token, unquoted).
;  Every file has the same keys as en.rc (tools\tests\test_lang.py checks it).
; ==============================================================================
